{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨日(3日)晚上11時52分，尖沙咀亞士厘道10-14號一單位，78歲印度裔男住戶報案，指發現上址有財物不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步點算，相信上址失去有一批共值約27萬港元的珠寶。經初步調查，案件列作「盜竊」，暫未有人被捕。據了解，事主疑其妻子盜走珠寶。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T20:20:50.691170+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T19:32:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:34.029793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:34.029793+00:00","content_hash":"9edebce18423d0bee08268a90bd6140a19d89bff1dab885c075e9c54ab124d63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}